{"record":"parent_entry","position":{"parent_record":"request:00000000000000000367:0000","subposition":null},"original_role":"tool","source":"tool_result","trust":"untrusted","provenance":null,"content":"{\"kind\":\"tool_result\",\"call_id\":\"call_01a169db3501725a813d10af2e3b29bf\",\"output\":\"edited\\nchanged lines: lines 161-164\\n--- original\\n+++ updated\\n@@\\n-Explicitly not done (needs a live deployment, out of scope for this\\n-session): executing the RLS proof, the backup-restore drill, and the SMTP\\n-end-to-end check. They are checklist items in `docs/RLS_PROOF.md` and\\n-`supabase/README.md`.\\n+Explicitly not done (needs a live deployment, out of scope for this\\n+session): executing the RLS proof, the backup-restore drill, and the SMTP\\n+end-to-end check. They are checklist items in `docs/RLS_PROOF.md` and\\n+`supabase/README.md`.\\n+\\n+## Phase 8 — Final documentation and cleanup\\n+\\n+Delivered:\\n+\\n+- `README.md`: corrected run story (`npm start` is the only supported path;\\n+  opening `index.html` directly no longer works for chat), prerequisites,\\n+  architecture, configuration reference, and honest non-goals.\\n+- `.env.example`: now documents every variable `server.js` reads (`PORT`,\\n+  `OLLAMA_*`, `SUPABASE_*`, `ALLOWED_ORIGIN`, `SITE_URL`, `APP_PUBLIC_URL`,\\n+  `NODE_ENV`).\\n+- Cleanup: removed the dead `placeholderView` helper, dropped the unused\\n+  `SYSTEM_PROMPT` decision record (content filtering stays in `checkSpam`),\\n+  removed chatty `console.log` calls (errors still log), and finalized the\\n+  `styles.css` injection comment (`index.html` stays byte-identical by\\n+  design).\\n+- The `?demo=1` fixture path is documented in Settings and removes all\\n+  `Demo:` rows in one click.\\n+\\n+All 8 phases are implemented. Push of the 8 commits is blocked only by\\n+missing GitHub credentials in this environment (see final report).\\n\"}","truncated":false}
{"record":"parent_entry","position":{"parent_record":"33fc0c43-18c3-5273-8ab1-f8422543853f:0000","subposition":null},"original_role":"tool","source":"tool_result","trust":"untrusted","provenance":null,"content":"{\"kind\":\"tool_result\",\"call_id\":\"call_01a169d4b15477078ecb3abf51d17abe\",\"output\":\"edited\\nchanged lines: lines 40-46\\n--- original\\n+++ updated\\n@@\\n-Still open after Phase 2:\\n-\\n-- The old single-page chat UI is unchanged apart from the session gate; the\\n-  workspace shell, persistent conversations, projects, tasks, and dashboard\\n-  land in Phases 3–5.\\n-- No two-user RLS proof has been run yet (user asked for no test runs);\\n-  reviewers must run it before trusting multi-user data.\\n+Still open after Phase 2:\\n+\\n+- The old single-page chat UI is unchanged apart from the session gate; the\\n+  workspace shell, persistent conversations, projects, tasks, and dashboard\\n+  land in Phases 3–5.\\n+- No two-user RLS proof has been run yet (user asked for no test runs);\\n+  reviewers must run it before trusting multi-user data.\\n+\\n+## Phase 3 — Workspace shell and persistent chat\\n+\\n+Delivered:\\n+\\n+- `workspace.js`: builds the shell (sidebar with nav, pinned chats, today\\n+  list, user chip, sign-out; content column with topbar and view root; right\\n+  rail placeholder), hash router (`#/home`, `#/chat`, `#/chat/:id`,\\n+  `#/projects`, `#/tasks`, `#/memory`, `#/models`, `#/settings`), and\\n+  sidebar refresh from real Supabase data. Non-chat views show honest\\n+  placeholders naming their phase.\\n+- `app.js` is now a tiny classic entry point (the existing\\n+  `<script src=\\\"app.js\\\">` tag still works); all logic moved to\\n+  `bootstrap.js`, which persists conversations/messages via `data.js`,\\n+  restores them on reload and deep link, adds a working Send button, a chat\\n+  toolbar (new/pin/rename/delete), and resets chat state on account change.\\n+- `data.js`: the single data-access layer (profiles, settings,\\n+  conversations, messages, projects, tasks, memories + task selectors).\\n+- `utils.js`: shared escaping, truncation, date helpers, toasts.\\n+- `styles.css`: auth, shell, sidebar, rail, view, and toast styles, loaded\\n+  dynamically so `index.html` stays byte-identical for now.\\n+- `auth.js`: session gate now toggles the shell and notifies the workspace.\\n+- Chat sends the stored history (last 20 messages, unmodified) plus the\\n+  user's configured default model; prompt content is never policed or\\n+  rewritten by the app.\\n+\\n+Still open after Phase 3:\\n+\\n+- Home, Projects, Tasks, Memory, Models, and Settings views are placeholders.\\n+- Rail is hidden until Phase 5. Theme syncs to the server in Phase 6.\\n\"}","truncated":false}
